xt":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami"}}}